Since `fields.Pluck` inherits from `Nested`, `isinstance(self.inner, Nested)` evaluates to `True`. When `self.inner` is a `Pluck` field without `many=True`, `List(Pluck(...))` triggers this optimization and calls `Pluck._serialize(value, many=True, ...)` directly on the collection of objects `value`. 

